'''Stephen B. Hobbs''' (born November 14, 1965) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[wide receiver]] for the [[Washington Redskins]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL).<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.nfl.com/player/stephenhobbs/2501185/profile|title=Stephen Hobbs|work=NFL player profile|accessdate=14 November 2013}}</ref> The 1991 season was his only complete season; injuries sidelined him during portions of his other playing years.<ref>{{cite news|url=http://articles.dailypress.com/keyword/stephen-hobbs|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20091217045543/http://articles.dailypress.com/keyword/stephen-hobbs|url-status=dead|archive-date=December 17, 2009|title=Burying Hobbs' Goblins|last=Hessler|first=Warner|date=July 28, 1994|work=Daily Press|accessdate=14 November 2013}}</ref> He played [[college football]] at the [[University of North Alabama]].
